WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.895
Today we will revise a work thoughtfully. Our work connects with other Ghanaian

00:00:04.895 --> 00:00:05.256
communities.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:09.253
Read or listen to one helpful comment on the draft.

00:00:10.117 --> 00:00:13.039
Choose one change that supports the artwork’s purpose.

00:00:14.117 --> 00:00:18.911
Make the change and explain how the second version improved. Compare your result with

00:00:18.911 --> 00:00:20.623
a second example from Ghana.
